    "created_at": "2019-06-21T21:46:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-06-21T21:46:12Z",
    "body": "Having discrete buckets for storage would be really nice for clearing out storage.\r\n\r\n1. It would potentially allow Clear Site Data to target a subset of the storage, reducing collateral damage during usage\r\n2. Makes it easier to manage and prioritize storage when storage allocation is low",
